x \\\\ f(0) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡0=1 \\\\ {f}^{′}(x) & =-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡3x \\\\ {f}^{′}(0) & =-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡0=0 \\\\ {f}^{″}(x) & =-3\\cdot 3\\operatorname{cos}⁡3x=-9\\operatorname{cos}⁡3x \\\\ {f}^{″}(0) & =-9\\operatorname{cos}⁡0=-9 \\\\ {f}^{‴}(x) & =-9(-3)\\operatorname{sin}⁡3x=27\\operatorname{sin}⁡3x \\\\ {f}^{‴}(0) & =27\\operatorname{sin}⁡0=0 \\\\ {f}^{(4)}(x) & =27\\cdot 3\\operatorname{cos}⁡3x=81\\operatorname{cos}⁡3x \\\\ {f}^{(4)}(0) & =81\\operatorname{cos}⁡0=81.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the Maclaurin expansion is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡3x & =(1)+(0)\\cdot x+\\frac{(-9)}{2!}{x}^{2}+\\frac{(0)}{3!}{x}^{3}+\\frac{(81)}{4!}{x}^{4}+⋯ \\\\  & =1-\\frac{9{x}^{2}}{2}+\\frac{27{x}^{4}}{8}+⋯\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534675 true] [17592186302791 1000 #edb/ref 17592186302792 13194139534675 true] [17592186302791 1000 #edb/ref 17592186302793 13194139534675 true] [17592186302791 1000 #edb/ref 17592186302794 13194139534675 true] [17592186302791 1000 #edb/ref 17592186302795 13194139534675 true] [17592186302791 1000 #edb/ref 17592186302796 13194139534675 true] [17592186302791 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534675 true] [17592186302791 1041 "selection" 13194139534675 true] [17592186302791 1104 #edb/ref 17592186302792 13194139534675 true] [17592186302791 1110 #uuid "5a0c3b52-e0aa-55ce-b519-6be07c67f03c" 13194139534675 true] [17592186302792 1034 "\\operatorname{cos}⁡3x=1-\\frac{9{x}^{2}}{2}+\\frac{27{x}^{4}}{8}+⋯" 13194139534675 true] [17592186302792 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534675 true] [17592186302792 1111 #uuid "739e0c32-7a9d-58f4-806c-f463a2c7bf41" 13194139534675 true] [17592186302793 1034 "\\operatorname{cos}⁡3x=1-\\frac{9{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{11{x}^{4}}{8}+⋯" 13194139534675 true] [17592186302793 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534675 true] [17592186302793 1111 #uuid "f396f375-f1a3-5fc6-86e8-321dcc5111a4" 13194139534675 true] [17592186302794 1034 "\\operatorname{cos}⁡3x=1+\\frac{9{x}^{2}}{2}-\\frac{2